---
import PageLayout from "../layouts/PageLayout.astro";
---

<PageLayout title="Circassian">
  <br />
  <div class="flag">
    <!-- STARS -->
    <!-- Left side -->
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 40px; left: 50px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 70px; left: 70px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 100px; left: 90px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 130px; left: 110px"></div>

    <!-- Middle center -->
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 110px; left: 135px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 110px; left: 165px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 110px; left: 195px"></div>

    <!-- Top center -->
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 140px; left: 165px"></div>

    <!-- Right side -->
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 40px; right: 50px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 70px; right: 70px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 100px; right: 90px"></div>
    <div class="star" style="bottom: 130px; right: 110px"></div>

    <!-- ARROWS -->
    <div
      class="arrow"
      style="bottom: 20px; left: 155px; transform: rotate(45deg);"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="arrow" style="bottom: 20px; left: 165px;"></div>
    <div
      class="arrow"
      style="bottom: 20px; left: 175px; transform: rotate(-45deg);"
    >
    </div>
  </div>
  <br />

  <p>
    "Adigha" / "Circassian" is an ethnic group of people from the geographic
    region of the North Western Caucasus. People use either of these words
    interchangably.
  </p>

  <figure>
    <img
      src="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caucasus"
      width="300"
      height="430"
      alt="Map of Caucasus from Wikipedia"
    />
    <figcaption>
      <p>Map of Caucasus from Wikipedia</p><p>
        <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caucasus">Source</a>
      </p>
    </figcaption>
  </figure>

  <br />
  <hr />
  <br />

  <p>
    To learn more about the Adigha / Circassian peoples, check out these
    resources:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a
        href="https://circassianworld.com/pdfs/circassian-customs-traditions.pdf"
        >Circassian Customs & Traditions by Amjad M. Jaimoukha</a
      >
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://circassianworld.com/pdfs/circassian-religion-beliefs.pdf"
        >Circassian Religion and Beliefs by Amjad M. Jaimoukha</a
      >
    </li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .flag {
    position: relative;
    width: 330px;
    height: 165px;
    background-color: #296912;
  }
  .star {
    position: absolute;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    background-color: #ecf003;
  }
  .arrow {
    position: absolute;
    background-color: #ecf003;
    width: 8px;
    height: 80px;
  }
</style>
